{"s":107,"name":"Al-Ma'un","meaning":"Almsgiving","arName":"سُورَةُ المَاعُونِ","type":"Meccan","verses":7,"juz":30,"page":602,"basmala":true,"ayahs":[{"a":1,"ar":"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","en":"Have you seen the one who denies the Recompense?","juz":30,"page":602},{"a":2,"ar":"فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِى يَدُعُّ ٱلْيَتِيمَ","en":"For that is the one who drives away the orphan","juz":30,"page":602},{"a":3,"ar":"وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","en":"And does not encourage the feeding of the poor.","juz":30,"page":602},{"a":4,"ar":"فَوَيْلٌۭ لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ","en":"So woe to those who pray","juz":30,"page":602},{"a":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ عَن صَلَاتِهِمْ سَاهُونَ","en":"[But] who are heedless of their prayer -","juz":30,"page":602},{"a":6,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ يُرَآءُونَ","en":"Those who make show [of their deeds]","juz":30,"page":602},{"a":7,"ar":"وَيَمْنَعُونَ ٱلْمَاعُونَ","en":"And withhold [simple] assistance.","juz":30,"page":602}]}